# Allowlist: only what the image needs. Anything not listed here (notes, prompts,
# tests, docs, local data, logs, editor files) never enters the build context.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!apps
!packages
!themes
!scripts
**/node_modules
**/dist
# The built TV app (apps/android-tv/dist) is served by the server when it exists.
!apps/android-tv/dist
**/data
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
